  {
   "section": "stories",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Lenovo Innovation in Action"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Read more success stories",
     "href": "https://www.lenovo.com/us/en/case-studies-customer-success-stories/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Formula 1"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "DreamWorks Animation"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Madison Square Garden"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Dallas Cowboys"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Lenovo Center & Carolina Hurricanes"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Doctors Without Borders"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "The Winning Formula"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Discover how Lenovo devices and IT infrastructure support the breakneck pace of innovation in the world’s most popular motorsport."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "https://www.lenovo.com/us/en/case-studies-customer-success-stories/formula-1"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "The impact"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "“Lenovo's very much a one-stop shop for us, which is fantastic. We not only get amazing technology but also access to some of the best techies and expertise to help us build solutions.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Chris Roberts"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "IT Director, Formula 1"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "HOW THEY DID IT"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Asset Recovery Services (ARS)"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "ThinkSystem Servers"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Edge Devices"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Motorola Mobile Devices"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "22"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Grand Prix races supported worldwide"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "1M+"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "Data points generated by each car"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "100M+"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "Global audience"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "Creativity Unleashed at DreamWorks Animation"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 27,
     "text": "Lenovo's workstations and patented Neptune® Liquid Cooling technology enable DreamWorks’ artists and filmmakers to bring their imaginations to life."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 28,
     "text": "See How",
     "href": "https://www.lenovo.com/us/en/case-studies-customer-success-stories/dreamworks-animation"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 29,
     "text": "The impact"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 30,
     "text": "“Lenovo's servers and their workstations are some of the best technology on the planet. They have given us and our filmmakers an incredible boost of computational power.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 31,
     "text": "Kate Swanborg"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 32,
     "text": "SVP, Technology Communications & Strategic Alliances, DreamWorks Animation"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 33,
     "text": "How they did it"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 34,
     "text": "High Performance Computing (HPC)"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 35,
     "text": "Neptune® Liquid Cooling technology"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 36,
     "text": "Lenovo workstations"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 37,
     "text": "Professional Services"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 38,
     "text": "300M"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 39,
     "text": "Computational hours rendered per film"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 40,
     "text": "$480M"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 41,
     "text": "Earned on Puss in Boots: The Last Wish"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 42,
     "text": "25"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 43,
     "text": "#1 Box office hits"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 44,
     "text": "Helping Small Businesses Score Big"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 45,
     "text": "We’re helping the MSG Family of Companies launch initiatives focused on small businesses and community organizations through programming with the New York Knicks and the Christmas Spectacular Starring the Radio City Rockettes."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 46,
     "text": "Learn More",
     "href": "https://www.lenovo.com/us/en/case-studies-customer-success-stories/msge"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 47,
     "text": "The impact"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 48,
     "text": "“Together, we will both further our shared commitment of giving back in meaningful ways to the local communities we serve and drive significant value for our businesses through high-profile brand exposure opportunities.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 49,
     "text": "Jamaal Lesane"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 50,
     "text": "Chief Operating Officer, MSG Sports"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 51,
     "text": "How they did it"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 52,
     "text": "Performance Computing (HPC)"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 53,
     "text": "Motorola Razr Smartphones"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 54,
     "text": "ThinkSystem Servers & Storage"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 55,
     "text": "Smart Collaboration Solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 56,
     "text": "2024"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 57,
     "text": "When the multi-year partnership launched"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 58,
     "text": "$50,000"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 59,
     "text": "Grand prize for a small business ad on MSG networks"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 60,
     "text": "10"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 61,
     "text": "Local small businesses received technology upgrades"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 62,
     "text": "Tackling Success With Tech"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 63,
     "text": "Discover how America's team is leveraging Lenovo's intelligent devices on and off the field to push the game of football forward."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 64,
     "text": "See How",
     "href": "https://www.lenovo.com/us/en/case-studies-customer-success-stories/dallas-cowboys"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 65,
     "text": "The impact"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 66,
     "text": "“Having Lenovo handle the right machine builds for the right positions means those are things you just don’t have to worry about.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 67,
     "text": "Matt Messick"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 68,
     "text": "CIO, Dallas Cowboys"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 69,
     "text": "How they did it"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 70,
     "text": "Desktops & Tablets"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 71,
     "text": "ThinkPad Laptops"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 72,
     "text": "ThinkStations"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 73,
     "text": "Collaboration Solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 74,
     "text": "1st"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 75,
     "text": "NFL team to use computers"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 76,
     "text": "2023"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 77,
     "text": "Lenovo named Dallas Cowboys Game Time hardware partner"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 78,
     "text": "#1"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 79,
     "text": "Most valuable franchise in sports"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 80,
     "text": "Accelerating Game-changing Performance Analytics"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 81,
     "text": "When the Hurricanes upgraded its IT with hyperconverged infrastructure from Lenovo, it tripled the performance of key analytics workloads."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 82,
     "text": "See The Action",
     "href": "https://www.lenovo.com/us/en/case-studies-customer-success-stories/carolina-hurricanes"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 83,
     "text": "The impact"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 84,
     "text": "“We can develop new insights into player performance faster and create new tools for strategizing about tactics. These insights also inform decisions around injury prevention and player recruitment.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 85,
     "text": "Glenn Johnson"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 86,
     "text": "CIO, Carolina Hurricanes"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 87,
     "text": "How they did it"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 88,
     "text": "ThinkAgile VX Integrated Systems"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 89,
     "text": "Premier Support Services"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 90,
     "text": "XClarity Management Software"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 91,
     "text": "Lenovo Servers"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 92,
     "text": "3x"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 93,
     "text": "Faster analytics"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 94,
     "text": "3.7"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 95,
     "text": "Years to achieve ROI"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 96,
     "text": "2021"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 97,
     "text": "Launched NHL Edge system to track puck and players"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 98,
     "text": "Delivering Critical IT in Extreme Conditions"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 99,
     "text": "With Lenovo edge servers and rugged ThinkPads, Doctors Without Borders runs portable data centers in the field, keeping teams connected where lives are on the line."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 100,
     "text": "See The Solution",
     "href": "https://www.lenovo.com/us/en/case-studies-customer-success-stories/medecins-sans-frontieres-geneva/"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 101,
     "text": "The impact"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 102,
     "text": "“Our field kits operate as a small data center directly on the field. The Lenovo ThinkSystem SE350 keeps us online, even in the harshest conditions.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 103,
     "text": "Jean Patrick Dye"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 104,
